# Cloudflare Pages response headers. Copied verbatim from public/ into dist/.
#
# HSTS tells a browser to refuse plaintext HTTP to this host for a year, which
# closes the gap where the first request to http://muncieradon.com travels in the
# clear before the 301 upgrades it.
#
# Deliberately WITHOUT `preload`. Preloading ships the domain inside browser
# binaries, and getting removed from that list takes months, so it is not a
# setting to enable on a site that is one day old. includeSubDomains is safe here
# because every hostname under this domain is served by Pages over HTTPS.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
